# NOTE: ScienceBase blocks scripted downloads (it answers with a Cloudflare challenge), so this file has to be downloaded by hand.
#  Open the data release page in a browser (https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/item/696a75d5d4be0228872d3bf8), download "MCS2026_Commodities_Data.csv", and run:
#  etls usgs/2026-11-09/mineral_commodity_summaries_2026 --path-to-file <path-to-downloaded-file>
#  Unlike earlier releases, there is no separate world data zip file; world production and reserves are in the "World ..." sections of this file.
